Contract: clamp_percent(value) returns the input percentage unchanged when it is between 0 and 100, returns 0 below 0, and 100 above 100. Code:

def clamp_percent(value):
    if value < 0:
        return 0
    if value > 100:
        return 100
    return value / 100

